#[navbar]

#[section, $md:
    @../../../ (Documentation) / @../ (Core packages) / Core text

    # Core text

    `@core/text` provides checks for `String` length, emptiness and substrings.
    Length counts Unicode scalar values rather than UTF-16 code units, which
    keeps the result aligned with Moth's `Char` model across backends.
]

